          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Conclusion and Recommendations</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The analysis of global fuel prices from 2020 to 2026 shows significant differences across countries and regions. Fuel prices are influenced by taxation policies, income levels, crude oil prices, and government subsidies.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Governments should focus on balanced taxation, transparent fuel pricing, and effective subsidies to make fuel more affordable for citizens.</run>
          </formatted-text>
